# Early Bird Catches the Bookworm (windurst 20): Glyph Hanger's completion sets the player local var
# Quest[2][20]mustZone (this quest's prefix), but this quest's offer reads quest:getMustZone, the char var of that name:
# so the offer is there at once, with no zone change (a kept quirk). The fame is raised before Glyph Hanger's
# completion (50, then 70: level 2), so the offer's other sides are met. Glyph Hanger completes on C# here (only this
# quest's Lua is laid over), as its own traces prove it against its Lua.
lists WindurstWaters/Tosuka-Porika/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Hariga-Origa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/385 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/387
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-60.5,-5.5,105.2
quest Windurst.GlyphHanger accepted
keyitem NoteFromIpupu
fame Windurst 50
login
trigger Hariga-Origa                # Glyph Hanger accepted, Ipupu's note held: 385
finish                              # Glyph Hanger completed (fame 70); local var Quest[2][20]mustZone 1
trigger Tosuka-Porika               # available, Glyph Hanger completed, fame level 2, the char var 0: 387 (the local var does not gate it)
finish option=1                     # declined: nothing
